{
    "title": "NKJV Bible offline app",
    "description": "NKJV Bible app - Get the complete New King James Version of the Holy Bible - now on your phone!\r\n\r\nOur app comes with the most intuitive features to help you connect to God, including reading plans and voice support. The app is fast, light, and easy on your device. Locate any verse with a single tap and make reading plans, or let the app read out loud to you.\r\n\r\nNow study God's word anytime, anywhere with the Bible NKJV - perfect for people on the go!\r\n\r\nSay yes to convenience with features like -\r\n\r\n1. Reading Plans - Choose from a wide variety of reading plans and stay on track with your Bible studies.\r\n\r\n2. Daily Verses - Stay inspired with daily verses that will uplift your spirit and deepen your faith. Customise to your liking and get verses from your favourite parts of the Bible.\r\n\r\n3. Statistics -  Track your progress and see how much of the Bible you have read, as well as your most-read verses. An intuitive interface lets you navigate with ease.\r\n\r\n4. Night Mode - Reading in the dark? No problem! Our NKJV Bible app comes with a useful Night Mode feature that makes reading in the dark comfortable for the eyes by reducing eye strain.\r\n\r\n5. Text-to-voice Support - Our app supports text-to-voice functionality, so you can listen to the Bible aloud while you're on the go.\r\n\r\nWith the New King James version Bible app, you'll always have the tools you need to dive deeper into God's Word and strengthen your spiritual journey wherever you go. Try it today with your friends and family!",
    "descriptionHTML": "NKJV Bible app - Get the complete New King James Version of the Holy Bible - now on your phone!<br><br>Our app comes with the most intuitive features to help you connect to God, including reading plans and voice support. The app is fast, light, and easy on your device. Locate any verse with a single tap and make reading plans, or let the app read out loud to you.<br><br>Now study God&#39;s word anytime, anywhere with the Bible NKJV - perfect for people on the go!<br><br>Say yes to convenience with features like -<br><br>1. Reading Plans - Choose from a wide variety of reading plans and stay on track with your Bible studies.<br><br>2. Daily Verses - Stay inspired with daily verses that will uplift your spirit and deepen your faith. Customise to your liking and get verses from your favourite parts of the Bible.<br><br>3. Statistics -  Track your progress and see how much of the Bible you have read, as well as your most-read verses. An intuitive interface lets you navigate with ease.<br><br>4. Night Mode - Reading in the dark? No problem! Our NKJV Bible app comes with a useful Night Mode feature that makes reading in the dark comfortable for the eyes by reducing eye strain.<br><br>5. Text-to-voice Support - Our app supports text-to-voice functionality, so you can listen to the Bible aloud while you&#39;re on the go.<br><br>With the New King James version Bible app, you&#39;ll always have the tools you need to dive deeper into God&#39;s Word and strengthen your spiritual journey wherever you go. Try it today with your friends and family!",
